    "https://www.ru.nl/en/working-at/job-opportunities": {
      "title": "Job opportunities",
      "description": "Job opportunities | Radboud University Skip to main content Home Education Show submenu Research Show submenu Services Show submenu Working at Show submenu Working at Come work with us and contribute to a healthy, free world with equal opportunities for everyone! Job opportunities Show submenu Job alert Application procedure Employment conditions Working in research & education Show submenu Working in staff & support roles Show submenu Support for international staff About us Show submenu Information for Students Show submenu Staff Show submenu Alumni Show submenu NL EN Search Clear all Breadcrumb Home Working at Job opportunities Job opportunities Search Clear all Result 1 - 15 of 15 results Filter results PhD Position: Mathematical Physics Job opportunity 1.0 FTE Gross monthly salary: € 3,204 - € 4,051 Faculty of Science Are you passionate about mathematical and theoretical physics, and interested in the history and philosophy of physics? Would you like to explore fundamental questions about black holes, entropy and irreversibility? If so, this PhD position could be… Associate or Full Professor of Science of High Magnetic Fields Job opportunity 1.0 FTE Faculty of Science Are you ready to dive into groundbreaking research in high magnetic fields? Are you eager to share and expand your knowledge? If so, join HFML-FELIX as an Associate or Full Professor at the Faculty of Science at Radboud University. Associate or Full Professor of High Magnetic Field and Intense Infrared/THz Science Job opportunity 0.8 - 1.0 FTE Faculty of Science Are you interested in groundbreaking research employing intense infrared/THz radiation in high magnetic fields and starting a new research group? If so, join HFML-FELIX as an Associate or Full Professor at the Faculty of Science at Radboud University… Two Postdoc Positions on Synthetic Cells Job opportunity 1.0 FTE Gross monthly salary: € 3,706 - € 5,760 Faculty of Science Contribute to breakthrough research on synthetic cells chemistry of the future. We are looking for two postdoctoral researchers to develop synthetic cells that can produce valuable products from waste streams. Postdoc Position: A Model-Based Approach to Understanding Cognitive Development in Early Childhood Job opportunity 0.8 - 1.0 FTE Gross monthly salary: € 4,925 - € 6,682 Faculty of Social Sciences How do infants learn, and how does early learning influence later intelligence? Join our interdisciplinary research team to develop and empirically test innovative Bayesian cognitive models that reveal the hidden cognitive processes underlying early… PhD Position: Fatigue in Motion Job opportunity 1.0 FTE Gross monthly salary: € 3,204 - € 4,051 Faculty of Social Sciences Fatigue profoundly impacts mobility and quality of life in people with neurological disorders, yet its effects on everyday movement remain poorly understood. In this PhD project, you will combine cutting-edge physiological measurements, motion… Educational innovator for Molecular Sciences Job opportunity 0.6 - 0.8 FTE Gross monthly salary: € 3,706 - € 5,760 Faculty of Science The future of molecular sciences education is being shaped today. As Educational Innovator, you will play a key role in redesigning our Bachelor's degree programmes, helping to create innovative courses, coherent learning pathways and meaningful… Grant and Research Advisor Job opportunity 0.8 - 1.0 FTE Nijmegen School of Management Do you want to help researchers achieve their full potential? As a Grant and Research Advisor, you will support leading research at Radboud University and work at the heart of our vibrant academic community in Nijmegen. Education and Research Technician at the Magnetic Resonance Research Center Internal job opportunity 0.8 - 1.0 FTE Gross monthly salary: € 3,706 - € 5,760 Faculty of Science Are you energetic, patient and passionate about experimental research? As a technician at the Magnetic Resonance Research Center (MRRC), you will be at the heart of their operation, helping to design, build, modify and support advanced magnetic… Assistant Professor of Clinical Neuropsychology or Neuropsychological Rehabilitation Job opportunity 0.95 - 1.0 FTE Gross monthly salary: € 5,932 - € 7,573 Faculty of Social Sciences The Department of Neuropsychology and Rehabilitation Psychology at Radboud University has a position for an assistant professor in the field of clinical neuropsychology or neuropsychological rehabilitation. This position involves 50% teaching and 50%… Associate Professor of Political Theory Job opportunity 0.8 - 1.0 FTE Gross monthly salary: € 7,097 - € 8,992 Nijmegen School of Management The Department of Political Science at the Nijmegen School of Management (Radboud University) is looking for an Associate Professor with the potential to achieve Full Professor status in the field of applied political theory within three to five… Assistant Professor of Organisation Design Internal job opportunity 0.8 - 1.0 FTE Gross monthly salary: € 4,925 - € 6,682 Nijmegen School of Management As Assistant Professor of Organisation Design at the Department of Business Administration of the Nijmegen School of Management (NSM), Radboud University, you will further develop research and teaching programmes in Business Administration. PhD Position at the Radboud Institute for Culture and History Job opportunity 0.8 - 1.0 FTE Gross monthly salary: € 3,204 - € 4,051 Faculty of Arts The Radboud Institute for Culture & History (RICH) is a research institute dedicated to exploring the present and the past through the lenses of culture, history, literature, and art. Would you like to research understandings of the dynamics of an… PhD Position at the Centre for Language Studies Job opportunity 0.8 - 1.0 FTE Gross monthly salary: € 3,204 - € 4,051 Faculty of Arts Language is what makes us human. That is why we need more research that helps us better understand language and how we use it. Would you like to contribute to a greater understanding of the cognitive and social processes underlying language systems… Assistant/Associate Professor of Mathematics Education Job opportunity 0.8 - 1.0 FTE Gross monthly salary: € 4,925 - € 8,992 Faculty of Science Join the Institute for Science Education as an Assistant or Associate Professor of Mathematics Education. In this role, you will translate fundamental insights into inspiring teacher education, contribute to educational innovation, and help… Working at Job opportunities Job opportunities from partners Job alert Application procedure Employment conditions Working in research & education Working in staff & support roles Support for international staff Close filters External / Internal External (13) External (13) Internal (2) Internal (2) Vacancy type Scientific (12) Scientific (12) Lecturer, Assistant Professor, Associate Professor, Professor (6) Lecturer, Assistant Professor, Associate Professor, Professor (6) PhD (4) PhD (4) Postdoc (2) Postdoc (2) Non-scientific (3) Non-scientific (3) Education (1) Education (1) Policy and Staff (1) Policy and Staff (1) Technical/Laboratory (1) Technical/Laboratory (1) Faculty / division Faculty of Arts (2) Faculty of Arts (2) Faculty of Science (7) Faculty of Science (7) Faculty of Social Sciences (3) Faculty of Social Sciences (3) Nijmegen School of Management (3) Nijmegen School of Management (3) No matching job opportunity? Create a job alert and stay informed about our latest vacancies. Footer menu [EN] Information for Students Staff Alumni Press Schools More about Programmes Research Facilities & collaborating Working at Radboud University Contact Contact details Find staff member How to get here Address Houtlaan 4 6525 XZ Nijmegen Contact us Footer secondary ©2026 - Disclaimer Privacy & cookies We use cookies This website uses functional and non-privacy invading cookies. Do you also accept the placement of other cookie types? Allow all cookies Don’t allow additional cookies More information"
